z\u00e9sen alapul, Geo Query be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1ssal."],"This filter for: Map Listing.":["Ez a sz\u0171r\u0151 ehhez val\u00f3: t\u00e9rk\u00e9pes list\u00e1z\u00e1s."],"The Map Listing must be present on the page and remain the main provider.":["A t\u00e9rk\u00e9pes list\u00e1z\u00e1snak jelen kell lennie az oldalon, \u00e9s f\u0151 adatszolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3k\u00e9nt kell m\u0171k\u00f6dnie."],"Additional providers update only when their query can consume the same Map Sync Geo Query data.":["A tov\u00e1bbi adatszolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3k csak akkor friss\u00fclnek, ha a lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9s\u00fck k\u00e9pes felhaszn\u00e1lni ugyanazokat a Map Sync Geo Query-adatokat."],"Leave empty for a single default map. With multiple maps, enter the target Map Listing CSS\/Element ID without #; it must match exactly.":["Hagyja \u00fcresen egyetlen alap\u00e9rtelmezett t\u00e9rk\u00e9p eset\u00e9n. T\u00f6bb t\u00e9rk\u00e9p eset\u00e9n adja meg a c\u00e9l t\u00e9rk\u00e9pes list\u00e1z\u00e1s CSS-\/elem-ID-j\u00e1t # n\u00e9lk\u00fcl; pontos egyez\u00e9s sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges."],"Map Sync":["T\u00e9rk\u00e9pszinkroniz\u00e1l\u00e1s"],"Map Listing Query ID:":["T\u00e9rk\u00e9pes list\u00e1z\u00e1s lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9si ID-ja:"],"Target: Default Map":["C\u00e9l: alap\u00e9rtelmezett t\u00e9rk\u00e9p"],"Invisible on the frontend":["A fel\u00fcleten nem l\u00e1that\u00f3"],"Requires a JetEngine Query Builder query with Geo Search configured and the Maps Listings module enabled.":["A haszn\u00e1lat\u00e1hoz Geo Search be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1ssal rendelkez\u0151 JetEngine Query Builder-lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9sre \u00e9s bekapcsolt Maps Listings modulra van sz\u00fcks\u00e9g."],"Text for user geolocation control":["A felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3i helymeghat\u00e1roz\u00e1s vez\u00e9rl\u0151j\u00e9nek sz\u00f6vege"],"Must match the target provider Query ID.":["Meg kell egyeznie a c\u00e9lszolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3 lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9s ID-j\u00e1val."],"Distance Control":["T\u00e1vols\u00e1gvez\u00e9rl\u